{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 在 S03、S11、S12、S13 的短时段里感受提示过密，容易让观众忙着追逐新出现的词，X 在整体扫读上更从容。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的【】能迅速让观众抓住人物每一阶段真正纠结的东西，尤其是从舍不得被当作自己人、害怕孤单，到不再逼自己选边、带着想念继续生活，心理变化的因果和前后呼应都更清楚。音乐感受也更细腻，具体到声音、动作、情绪转折，并且能在对应乐段出现，不只是笼统地给音乐贴情绪标签。X 的优势是叙述紧凑、左右分区稳定，扫读负担更低，但对人物内心动机的区分和音乐细节的呈现不如 Y 充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c6e14483-f2f2-471b-83d4-e4da0b51a441", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T164116990394Z", "elapsed_seconds": 120.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:43:17.058468+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d22f94ccb1448d70d8d7478350c6ce73422162812e6ef9cca324c2525a9692ac", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg